                "@type": "Question",
                "name": "Is offshore development to India GDPR compliant?",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                  "@type": "Answer",
                  "text": "It can be. GDPR allows transfers outside the EU with appropriate safeguards such as Standard Contractual Clauses. Ladder7 signs Data Processing Agreements including Standard Contractual Clauses, and can host data in EU or UK regions."
